# Build context filter for `Containerfile.local-test` only.
#
# The main `.containerignore` excludes `target/` because the production
# Containerfile builds Rust inside the image. Our local-test image
# copies the *already-built* binary from `target/release/`, so we need
# a different filter:
#
#   * exclude everything (the cache + sources we don't need)
#   * but DO include `target/release/sovereign-cli` and
#     `sovereign/container/entrypoint.sh` — the only two things
#     `Containerfile.local-test` COPYs in.
#
# Negation `!path` re-includes a path that earlier patterns excluded.
# Order matters: include rules must come after the bulk exclude.

# Bulky directories that have no business in any container build.
sovereign/models/
**/.git/

# Everything under target/ EXCEPT the release binary.
target/*
!target/release
target/release/*
!target/release/sovereign-cli
